WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.507
"The guards are coming!" the servant repeated.

2
00:00:05.508 --> 00:00:08.996
"Uh-oh," said Vinnie.

3
00:00:08.997 --> 00:00:14.901
"Someone must have seen us sneak into the palace," cried Mandy.

4
00:00:14.902 --> 00:00:17.485
Gildong's face was pale.

5
00:00:17.486 --> 00:00:21.555
"We will go to jail if they find us here," he said.

6
00:00:21.556 --> 00:00:23.799
The princess stood.

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.691
"Don't worry! I have a plan," she said.

8
00:00:27.692 --> 00:00:30.348
"I will hide you in my palanquin.

9
00:00:30.349 --> 00:00:33.943
Then my servants will carry you out of the palace."

10
00:00:33.944 --> 00:00:36.840
"Prepare my palanquin at the backdoor!"

11
00:00:36.841 --> 00:00:39.352
the princess ordered a servant.

12
00:00:39.353 --> 00:00:44.646
"Yes, Your Highness," the servant replied and then hurried off.

13
00:00:44.647 --> 00:00:49.000
Soon the children were following the princess.

14
00:00:49.001 --> 00:00:52.346
Mandy stopped when she heard something.

15
00:00:52.347 --> 00:00:55.670
"Is that a guitar?" she asked.

16
00:00:55.671 --> 00:00:58.234
Gildong stopped too.

17
00:00:58.235 --> 00:01:02.825
"I think it's a string instrument, a geomungo, " he

18
00:01:02.826 --> 00:01:05.187
said. "Only rich people play

19
00:01:05.188 --> 00:01:09.899
it." "Come on!" The princess waved for them to catch

20
00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:13.380
up. Then she led them to a small

21
00:01:13.381 --> 00:01:18.894
courtyard. Four servants stood waiting there beside a beautiful

22
00:01:18.895 --> 00:01:23.452
palanquin. "They will carry you outside the palace," said the

23
00:01:23.453 --> 00:01:26.010
princess. "So I must say good-bye

24
00:01:26.011 --> 00:01:31.353
now." "Good-bye," said Mandy. "And thank

25
00:01:31.354 --> 00:01:34.753
you!" Vinnie and Gildong said thanks

26
00:01:34.754 --> 00:01:38.473
too. Then the three of them ducked into the

27
00:01:38.474 --> 00:01:43.376
palanquin. A moment later Mandy felt the palanquin start to

28
00:01:43.377 --> 00:01:46.621
move. "We're off!" she thought.

29
00:01:46.622 --> 00:01:50.766
Then Vinnie nudged her and showed her the photo.

30
00:01:50.767 --> 00:01:55.367
"Mandy, the photo is glowing blue!" he whispered.

31
00:01:55.368 --> 00:02:00.998
"But where are the three gates?" she whispered back.

32
00:02:00.999 --> 00:02:03.972
Soon the palanquin stopped.

33
00:02:03.973 --> 00:02:09.045
When they climbed out, they saw they were outside the palace gates.

34
00:02:09.046 --> 00:02:13.668
The four men bowed and went back to the palace.

35
00:02:13.669 --> 00:02:17.963
"I must go home to do my chores," Gildong said.

36
00:02:17.964 --> 00:02:19.612
"Good-bye!"

37
00:02:19.613 --> 00:02:21.545
"Thank you for everything!"

38
00:02:21.546 --> 00:02:25.009
said Vinnie, waving to their new friend.

39
00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:28.037
"Good-bye!" Mandy added.

40
00:02:28.038 --> 00:02:31.136
She turned and grabbed Vinnie's arm.

41
00:02:31.137 --> 00:02:35.202
"Come on! Let's see if these are the right gates."

42
00:02:35.203 --> 00:02:38.791
But Vinnie already knew that they were.

43
00:02:38.792 --> 00:02:41.020
He looked at the photo.

44
00:02:41.021 --> 00:02:44.929
It was glowing red.

45
00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:48.106
"We're going home!" he whispered.

46
00:02:48.107 --> 00:02:51.636
The children fell into the tunnel.

47
00:02:51.637 --> 00:02:56.393
When they opened their eyes again, they were back in the attic.

48
00:02:56.394 --> 00:03:00.492
Mandy put the photo back inside the album.

49
00:03:00.493 --> 00:03:06.403
"That palanquin ride reminded me of our Japan trip," she said.

50
00:03:06.404 --> 00:03:09.617
"Yes," Vinnie said, nodding.

51
00:03:09.618 --> 00:03:15.817
"There's only one more page in the album," she said slowly.

52
00:03:15.818 --> 00:03:18.942
"I know," he answered.

53
00:03:18.943 --> 00:03:24.835
"That means there's just one more photo trip left," Mandy added.

54
00:03:24.836 --> 00:03:27.684
Vinnie didn't say anything.

55
00:03:27.685 --> 00:03:29.554
He just nodded.

56
00:03:29.555 --> 00:03:36.125
Then he turned away to hide the sad look on his face.

